# expect: total: 3
# expect: total: 30
# expect: val: 10
# §12 migration guard: `$[...]` (juxtaposition) interpolation must keep
# working once `$(...)` (infix) interpolation is removed. Mirrors the
# test_dollar_paren_compile_* coverage in C, but in jacl-fixture form so
# it survives PR 2's deletion of the C-side $() tests.
print "total: $[+ 1 2]"
def price 10
def qty 3
print "total: $[* $price $qty]"
def x 5
def y [+ 2 3]
print "val: $[+ $x $y]"
